  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local Governance-UNDP-LBY-00133893</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based on prior lessons and investments in governance in Libya, UNDP Libya has revisited its approach to local governance through a three-layer strategy fostering more effective, democratic, and accountable governance at the local level. (1) In coordination with international partners, UNDP will support the government at policy level, especially the Ministry of Local Government (MoLG) in its decentralisation efforts at legal/regulatory, institutional, and planning level, including fostering e-gov</narrative>
  </description>
